Start a new PT_NOTE segment wherever the note alignment changes, as lld does, and raise
each note section's alignment to that of its contents. A single PT_NOTE that held the 8-byte
.note.gnu.property and the 4-byte ABI tag and build ID notes made readers that walk notes by
the segment's alignment misparse them.

